# AGENT.md - Codebase Information for Coding Agents

## Project Structure
This codebase consists of two main packages:
1. `vscode-scoped-styles-languageserver` - Language server implementation
2. `vscode-scoped-styles-syntax` - Syntax highlighting extension

## Build Commands

### Language Server
```bash
# Install dependencies for both client and server
npm install  # or: npm run postinstall

# Compile TypeScript code
npm run compile

# Watch mode for development
npm run watch
```

### Syntax Package
No explicit build commands (primarily JSON configuration files).

## Test Commands

### Language Server
```bash
# Run all tests
npm test  # Runs e2e.sh script after compiling

# Run specific test (after compiling)
npm run compile
cd client
npx mocha out/test/completion.test.js
# Or by test name
npx mocha out/test/completion.test.js -g "Completes CSS in scoped-styles component"
```

### Syntax Package
No automated tests. Manual test fixtures in `test/fixture/`.

## Test Organization

### Language Server
- Uses Mocha with TDD UI
- Test files in `client/src/test/` with `.test.ts` extension
- Main test files:
  - `completion.test.ts` - Code completion tests
  - `hover.test.ts` - Hover information tests
  - `helper.ts` - Test helper functions
  - `index.ts` - Test runner
  - `runTest.ts` - Entry point for VS Code extension testing
- Test fixtures in `client/testFixture/`
- Uses VS Code's extension testing framework (`vscode-test`)

## Linting and Formatting
Both packages use `ts-standard`:
```bash
npm run lint    # Lint code
npm run format  # Format code
